# Drift Dashboard — UI Design Document v2 (updated for N-run + relatedness requirements)

Companion to `telemetry-drift-detector-spec-input.md`. Same editable format as the first breakdown: each component has what it shows, what it means, current spec, and a blank `> Your notes:` line. Every section is tagged **[NEW]**, **[UPDATED]**, or **[UNCHANGED]** against the v1 design so you can see exactly what moved.

This version designs for the **general N-run case** (1 to many logs), not just the fixed two-run layout from v1. Where behavior differs by how many runs are loaded, both states are described.

