## 1. Screen flow **[NEW]**

v1 was a 2-screen flow (Upload → Dashboard). Adding the relatedness check inserts a step that only appears when it's needed.

```
Upload  →  [2+ files uploaded?]  →  Relatedness Check  →  Dashboard
   |                                        |
   |—— 1 file only ————————————————————————————→  Single-run view (no diff language)
```

- 1 file uploaded: skip straight to a single-run view (§9).
- 2+ files uploaded: always pass through the Relatedness Check screen before the comparison dashboard — even if confidence is high, so the user sees *why* the system considers them comparable, not just the resulting numbers.

