## 12. Single-run view **[NEW — for the N=1 case]**

**What it shows:** When only one log is uploaded, the dashboard shell stays the same (top bar, run identity card) but everything comparison-shaped disappears:

| # | Behavior |
|---|---|
| 12.1 | No Relatedness Check screen (nothing to compare) |
| 12.2 | KPI section shows this run's headline numbers with no "vs" language and no drift chips (there's no baseline to drift from) |
| 12.3 | Charts show this run's own values only (e.g., overhead-ratio trend is a single line, not a comparison) |
| 12.4 | Full table becomes a simple metrics list: Metric \| Value — no Diff/Signal columns |
| 12.5 | Root cause / top driver panel is replaced by a plain "Session summary" panel (no comparison to explain) |

